{"articleNo":"182876","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=182876&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2018-1학기 교내 성적장학생 선발관련 외국어시험성적 제출안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.11.03","hit":"7924","attachments":[{"name":"공인외국어성적+환산표(장학지침+별표1).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=182876&attachNo=5595"},{"name":"2018-1학기 교내성적장학생 선발관련 외국어시험성적표 제출 안내(공고용).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=182876&attachNo=5604"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e4f7ba\" color=\"#6600ff\"><strong>2018학년도 1학기 </strong></font></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e4f7ba\" color=\"#6600ff\"><strong>\"교내 성적장학생 선발관련 </strong></font></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e4f7ba\" color=\"#6600ff\"><strong>외국어시험성적 제출 안내\"</strong></font></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">2018학년도 1학기 교내 성적우수장학생 및 성적오름장학생 선발을 위한</font></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">외국어시험성적표 제출방법을 아래와 같이 안내하오니 기한 내에 제출하시기 바랍니다.</font></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#030066\"><strong></strong></font>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#030066\"><strong>*외국어성적이 없을 경우 성적우수장학생 및 성적오름장학생 선발에서 제외됩니다.*</strong></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">*외국어 성적 제출 흐름 간략 설명</font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; : 적용기준내에 취득한 성적을 원스톱서비스에 입력→행정실에 외국어성적표 제출→승인완료</font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">*국제교류교육원에서 인정하는 모의토익성적도 외국어성적으로&nbsp;반영됩니다.</font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 국제교류교육원에서 응시하여 인정받을수 있는 모의토익성적은 학교에서 일괄 등록하므로 별도 제출하지 않아도 됨</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">☞<strong> 등록된 외국어성적 확인방법 : 원스톱서비스-학생포트폴리오-비교과활동(공인)-공인외국어시험-조회-공인외국어시험성적표목록에서 등재된 외국어성적 전체 조회됨</strong></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">1. 제출 대상</font></span></span></span></p></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; - 현재 재학생으로 2017-2학기 성적 이수예정자</span></span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;단, &nbsp;2018년 2월 졸업(수료)예정자,&nbsp;학기초과자, 졸업유예자 제외</span></font></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">2. 외국어시험성적 적용기준 : 2016.12.1.~2017.11.30.(1년)까지 취득한 성적</font></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; - </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">성적 입력 및 성적표 제출 기간 : 2017.12.29.(금)까지</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; - 성적 입력절차</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 원스톱서비스-학생포트폴리오-비교과활동(공인)-공인외국어시험-</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 공인외국어시험성적표 제출내역 입력-평가자료 등재바로가기-</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 등재신청서 인쇄-승인요청-외국어 성적표 제출</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; - 성적표 제출 장소 : 해당 학부(과) 전공 종합학사행정실<font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">(안내문 3페이지 참조)</span></font></span></font></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; - 성적&nbsp;<font color=\"#000000\">지도교수 승인(등재)완료 : 2018.1.10.(수)까지</font></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; ※ 등재완료 및 승인일을 반드시 확인하시기 바랍니다.</font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">3. 안내사항</font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; - 외국어성적을 제출하지 않은 학생은 교내 성적장학금을 받을 수 없습니다.</font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; - 반드시 등재완료 및 승인완료(승인일)을 확인하시기 바랍니다.</font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-paddi